Package: mlsas
Type: Package
Title: A Machine-Learning-Based Spatial Autocorrelation Statistic
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Woohyung", "Kim", email = "whk3423@snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sang-Il", "Lee", role = "aut"))
Author: Woohyung Kim [aut, cre], Sang-Il Lee [aut]
Maintainer: Woohyung Kim <whk3423@snu.ac.kr>
Description: Learns attribute similarity with an unsupervised random forest and
    computes global and local spatial autocorrelation statistics. Provides total
    and conditional Monte Carlo randomization inference, spatial weights,
    small synthetic examples, and explicit input validation. Implements the method
    of Kim and Lee (2026) <doi:10.1111/gean.70062>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: randomForest, Matrix, sf, spdep, parallel, stats, graphics, utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/geowhk/ml-sas-r, https://doi.org/10.1111/gean.70062
BugReports: https://github.com/geowhk/ml-sas-r/issues
